<title>USA: Storage Technology to buy 1.5 mln shares.</title>
<headline>Storage Technology to buy 1.5 mln shares.</headline>
<dateline>LOUISVILLE, Colo. 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Storage Technology Corp said Thursday it will repurchase of up to 1.5 million shares of its common stock on an annualized basis.</p>
<p>The company said it wants to offset dilution associated with employee stock purchase and stock option plans.</p>
<p>Outstanding shares total 61.9 million.</p>
<p>StorageTek provides network computing products and services used to store, transport and secure data.</p>
</text>
